WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.543
The checkpoint tests practical classification and lookup.

2
00:00:05.543 --> 00:00:10.503
Separate the family or code base from a named core.

3
00:00:10.503 --> 00:00:17.992
Decode CV32E20 without turning the part number into a complete specification.

4
00:00:17.992 --> 00:00:23.438
Identify CORE-V-XIF as the integration path of CV32E40X.

5
00:00:23.438 --> 00:00:29.176
Distinguish integer-register width from instruction length.

6
00:00:29.176 --> 00:00:37.540
Finally, select the three identity CSRs that belong in a release-level hardware check.

